### 商品列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/product/list

### 库存列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stock/list

### 订单列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/order/list

### 经营看板汇总
GET http://localhost:8080/api/order/dashboard/summary

### 创建订单 - 正常扣减库存
POST http://localhost:8080/api/order/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "quantity": 2,
  "receiverName": "张三",
  "receiverPhone": "13800138000",
  "receiverAddress": "北京市海淀区中关村南大街5号"
}

### 创建订单 - 库存不足
POST http://localhost:8080/api/order/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 2,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "quantity": 99,
  "receiverName": "张三",
  "receiverPhone": "13800138000",
  "receiverAddress": "北京市海淀区中关村南大街5号"
}

### 支付回调 - 把订单改为已支付
POST http://localhost:8080/api/pay/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNo": "DD202505190002",
  "payStatus": "支付成功",
  "payMethod": "支付宝",
  "callbackContent": "{\"tradeStatus\":\"SUCCESS\"}"
}

### AI 客服 - 查询订单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "question": "我的订单DD202505190003到哪了？"
}

### AI 推荐
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai/recommendations
